                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>This meeting was a continuation of the restricted session held during the morning
                    of October 2 and involved the same principal participants assisted by one
                    adviser each (see <ref target="#pg1325">page 1325</ref>). A brief summary of the
                    proceedings of this meeting is included in the telegraphic summary by the United
                    States Delegation, October 3, on <ref target="#pg1324">page 1324</ref>; a
                    19-page verbatim record of this restricted meeting is in the Conference files,
                    lot 60 D 627, CF 368.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
